$\F_q^{2m + 2}$ and $\mH \in \{ \mH_\alice,\mH_\bob\}$ there exists a POVM $\{ \hat{Q}^\line_f \}$ acting on
$\mathcal{H} \otimes (\C^q)^{\otimes \nqubits}$ with outcomes $f\in
